287
00:14:35.584 --> 00:14:37.210
Bringing color to her cheeks.

288
00:14:37.294 --> 00:14:38.920
Good idea.

289
00:14:39.004 --> 00:14:41.214
- Where's Cinderella?
- She's still in that basement.

290
00:14:41.298 --> 00:14:44.342
