- I'm starting to think she doesn't like us.

291
00:14:44.426 --> 00:14:46.219
Cinderella!
Girls, can you help me?

292
00:14:46.303 --> 00:14:48.096
Cinderella!

293
00:14:49.514 --> 00:14:51.766
Cinderella!

294
00:14:54.269 --> 00:14:57.480
